  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan forced. Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks. Roughly chop capsicum. Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63eb2ded7e26a9cd9d005a12/step-4ba2e5eb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, finely chop garlic. Thinly slice brown onion. Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63eb2ded7e26a9cd9d005a12/step-f1f279a1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add onion and cook, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic and garlic & herb seasoning and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63eb2ded7e26a9cd9d005a12/step-878195b6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To the saucepan, add chickpeas, diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the water, the honey and vegetable stock pot. Bring to the boil, then simmer for 3-4 minutes, or until slightly thickened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63eb2ded7e26a9cd9d005a12/step-07329780.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the soup is simmering, roughly chop semi-dried tomatoes.\n• To the soup, add roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves. Gently stir to combine until leaves are wilted, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63eb2ded7e26a9cd9d005a12/step-047855f7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the Mediterranean chickpea & veggie stew between bowls.\n• Top with a dollop of basil pesto, semi-dried tomatoes and crumble over fetta cubes to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63eb2ded7e26a9cd9d005a12/step-e08b8032.jpg"
    }
  ]
